# E04 bounded live test, claude-haiku-5-5 (Anthropic Messages API), 2026-10-25
# Cap: 25 calls in total, enforced twice: the wrapper counted every "API call"
# line already logged and passed FE2_NPC_MAX_CALLS = 25 - that to each run; the
# binary sends no request past the cap. max_tokens 256 per reply.
# The key came from the macOS Keychain into each run's environment only; after
# every run a search of all its output for the key prefix found nothing.
# Flags: FE2_NPC_LLM=1 FE2_NPC_LOG_PROMPTS=1 FE2_FRAME_STATS=1, FE2_NPC_PERSONA
# per run (formal is Sirocco Station's own voice). Test-line runs:
# FE2_NPC_TEST_LINES=live-test-lines.tsv or live-safety-probes.tsv with
# FE2_SCRIPT=live-wait-script.txt (1500 frames, no input). In-game runs:
# capture-script.txt, FE2_NPC_CACHE=<scratch file>.
# Lines below are the FE2_NPC, Message and frame-stat lines of each run, in
# order, unedited except the scratch path of the cache file.

